  "worked_solution": "The terms of the expression are $x$ and $4y.$ Looking at each term individually, we see that\n\n- the coefficient of the term $x$ is $1$, and\n\n- the coefficient of the term $4y$ is $4.$\n\nSo, the coefficients of $x$ and $y$ of the given expression are $1$ and $4,$ respectively.",
